License: other
 Generated by tools/module-notices. The file reproduces the license and
 notice texts of the Go standard library and of each Go module linked into
 the gopmgr binary. Each reproduced text keeps its own terms. The binary
 package installs it as /usr/share/doc/gopmgr/go-module-notices.txt.

