 /usr/share/doc/gopmgr/duckdb-native-notices.txt.

Files: vendor/**
Copyright: individual upstream contributors
License: see individual files
Comment: The vendored tree must not contain DuckDB's libtpch_extension.a or
 libtpcds_extension.a; debian/rules fails the build if it does (see
 LICENSES.md, "Excluded: the TPC-H and TPC-DS generators").
 The vendored dependency graph retains each upstream component's licensing and
 copyright notices in its source tree.

